\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 # \uc0\u55358 \u56598  AI Code Reviewer Bot\
\
Automated code review bot powered by Claude AI. Catches bugs, security issues, and suggests improvements on every PR.\
\
## \uc0\u10024  Features\
\
- **Automated Analysis** - Reviews every PR automatically\
- **Multi-Level Severity** - Critical issues, warnings, and suggestions\
- **Smart Formatting** - Clean, actionable comments on each line\
- **Zero Configuration** - Works out of the box\
- **Fast & Efficient** - Processes PRs in seconds\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56960  Quick Start\
\
### 1. Add to Your Repository\
\
Create `.github/workflows/review.yml` in your repo:\
\
```yaml\
name: AI Code Review\
on:\
  pull_request:\
    types: [opened, synchronize]\
\
jobs:\
  review:\
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\
    permissions:\
      pull-requests: write\
    steps:\
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\
      - uses: YOUR_USERNAME/ai-code-reviewer@main\
        with:\
          CLAUDE_API_KEY: $\{\{ secrets.CLAUDE_API_KEY \}\}\
